# 通用 Enricher 抽象设计 (v2)

## 核心思路

一次"富化"的本质：
1. 给一批源实体 `E`
2. 声明若干"关联查找"（每个查找：从 `E` 取一个 Long 键 → 用某个 `BatchLoader` 拉出 `T`）
3. 框架自动批量加载（每类一次 `selectBatchIds`），收集到一个**类型安全的上下文**
4. 业务侧用 `(E, Context) -> R` 拼出最终 DTO

后面想加 `ReviewerEntity`、`TemplateVersionEntity`、字典翻译、租户信息 等都同一套用法。

## API 形态

新增包 `backend/host-infra/src/main/java/com/labelhub/infra/enrich/`：

```java
public final class LookupKey<T> {
    public static <T> LookupKey<T> of(String name) { ... }
}

@FunctionalInterface
public interface BatchLoader<T> {
    Map<Long, T> loadByIds(Set<Long> ids);
}

public final class EnrichmentSpec<E> {
    public <T> EnrichmentSpec<E> lookup(
            LookupKey<T> key,
            Function<E, Long> idExtractor,
            BatchLoader<T> loader);
}

public final class EnrichmentContext {
    public <T> T get(LookupKey<T> key, Long id);
}

@Component
public class BatchEnricher {
    public <E, R> List<R> enrich(List<E> entities, EnrichmentSpec<E> spec,
                                 BiFunction<E, EnrichmentContext, R> builder);
    public <E, R> R enrichOne(E entity, EnrichmentSpec<E> spec,
                              BiFunction<E, EnrichmentContext, R> builder);
}
```

### 通用 Loader 适配器

```java
public final class MyBatisBatchLoaders {
    public static <T extends AbstractEntity> BatchLoader<T> softDelete(
            BaseMapper<T> mapper, Function<T, Long> idOf);
    public static <T> BatchLoader<T> simple(BaseMapper<T> mapper, Function<T, Long> idOf);
}

public final class UserDisplayLoader {
    public static BatchLoader<String> displayNames(UserDisplayNameResolver resolver);
}
```

`UserDisplayLoader` 内部就是 `ids.stream().collect(toMap(id -> id, resolver::resolve))`——`@Cacheable` 已挡住重复查询，不必再发明批量接口。

## 数据流

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    Caller["业务 Enricher\n(AssignmentSummaryEnricher / ...)"] -->|"List<E>, spec, builder"| BE[BatchEnricher]
    BE -->|"按 LookupKey 分组 ids"| TaskLoader["BatchLoader for TaskEntity"]
    BE --> ItemLoader["BatchLoader for TaskItemEntity"]
    BE --> UserLoader["BatchLoader for labelerName"]
    BE -->|"组装 EnrichmentContext"| Builder
    Builder["builder.apply(E, ctx)"] -->|"DTO"| Caller
```

## 业务侧改造

`AssignmentSummaryEnricher` 缩成 ~40 行：

```java
@Component
public class AssignmentSummaryEnricher {
    static final LookupKey<TaskEntity> TASK = LookupKey.of("task");
    static final LookupKey<TaskItemEntity> ITEM = LookupKey.of("item");
    static final LookupKey<String> LABELER = LookupKey.of("labelerName");

    private final BatchEnricher batchEnricher;
    private final ObjectMapper objectMapper;
    private final EnrichmentSpec<AssignmentEntity> spec;

    AssignmentSummaryEnricher(BatchEnricher batchEnricher,
                              TaskMapper taskMapper, TaskItemMapper itemMapper,
                              UserDisplayNameResolver resolver, ObjectMapper om) {
        this.batchEnricher = batchEnricher;
        this.objectMapper = om;
        this.spec = EnrichmentSpec.<AssignmentEntity>create()
            .lookup(TASK, AssignmentEntity::getTaskId,
                    MyBatisBatchLoaders.softDelete(taskMapper, TaskEntity::getId))
            .lookup(ITEM, AssignmentEntity::getItemId,
                    MyBatisBatchLoaders.softDelete(itemMapper, TaskItemEntity::getId))
            .lookup(LABELER, AssignmentEntity::getLabelerId,
                    UserDisplayLoader.displayNames(resolver));
    }

    public List<AssignmentSummary> enrichSummaries(List<AssignmentEntity> es) {
        return batchEnricher.enrich(es, spec, this::build);
    }
    public AssignmentSummary toSummary(AssignmentEntity e) {
        return batchEnricher.enrichOne(e, spec, this::build);
    }

    private AssignmentSummary build(AssignmentEntity e, EnrichmentContext ctx) {
        TaskEntity task = ctx.get(TASK, e.getTaskId());
        TaskItemEntity item = ctx.get(ITEM, e.getItemId());
        Map<String, Object> preview = item != null
                ? TaskPayloadPreviewSupport.toPayloadPreview(objectMapper, item.getPayloadJson())
                : Map.of();
        return new AssignmentSummary(
                e.getId(), e.getTaskId(), e.getItemId(), e.getSlotNo(),
                e.getLabelerId(), ctx.get(LABELER, e.getLabelerId()),
                e.getAssignType(), e.getStatus(),
                task != null ? task.getTitle() : null,
                task != null ? task.getTaskCode() : null,
                item != null ? item.getSeqNo() : null,
                item != null ? item.getSourceItemKey() : null,
                preview,
                e.getAssignedAt(), e.getClaimedAt(), e.getDeadlineAt(), e.getCreatedAt());
    }
}
```

`SubmissionSummaryEnricher` 同样：复用同一组 `LookupKey`（可下沉到一个共用 `TaskLookupKeys` 常量类，避免每个 Enricher 各自声明）。`toDetail` 多写一个 `buildDetail`，共享同一份 spec。

`resolveLabelerName(Long)` 这类零碎工具方法直接保留，内部委托 `userDisplayNameResolver`。

## 验证范围

新增测试：

- `BatchEnricherTest`：核心调度（空列表跳过、各 LookupKey 各调用一次 `loadByIds`、ID 为 null 不参与 IN）
- `MyBatisBatchLoadersTest`：软删过滤、`id -> entity` 映射
- `UserDisplayLoaderTest`：去重 + 缓存场景

原 `AssignmentSummaryEnricherTest` / `SubmissionSummaryEnricherTest` 保留，验证 DTO 字段映射完整。

## 文件影响面

新增（`backend/host-infra/.../enrich/`）：
- `LookupKey.java`、`BatchLoader.java`、`EnrichmentSpec.java`、`EnrichmentContext.java`、`BatchEnricher.java`
- `MyBatisBatchLoaders.java`、`UserDisplayLoader.java`

改造：
- [backend/host-infra/src/main/java/com/labelhub/infra/business/AssignmentSummaryEnricher.java](backend/host-infra/src/main/java/com/labelhub/infra/business/AssignmentSummaryEnricher.java)：127 → ~40 行
- [backend/host-infra/src/main/java/com/labelhub/infra/business/SubmissionSummaryEnricher.java](backend/host-infra/src/main/java/com/labelhub/infra/business/SubmissionSummaryEnricher.java)：196 → ~70 行

公开方法签名不变，`DbAssignmentService` / `DbSubmissionService` / `DbLabelerWorkbenchService` 无需改动。

## 复杂度权衡

|  | v1 组合（仅 TaskItemDisplayLoader） | v2 通用框架 |
|---|---|---|
| 新增代码量 | ~150 行 | ~300 行（含测试） |
| 应用范围 | 只解 task/item/labeler | 任意"实体 + 关联批量加载" |
| 新增一种关联（如 reviewer） | 改 Loader 内部 + DTO 字段 | spec 加一行 `.lookup(...)` |
| 学习成本 | 直观 | 需要理解 LookupKey/spec |

如果以后还有 reviewer、template version、organization 等同款需求，v2 收益明显；如果就这两个 Enricher，v1 性价比更高。

要不要按 v2 通用框架落地？还是看到具体代码后再决定要不要这么"重"？

 The user wants a more general framework rather than something task-specific. I'm thinking about a pattern where I take a list of source entities, extract related lookup keys from each one (like taskId, itemId, labelerId, etc.), and then batch-load all the related entities by their kind.

I'm sketching out a design with an `EnrichmentSpec` that lets you register lookup bindings, a `BatchLoader` interface for pluggable loading strategies, and an `EnrichmentContext` that holds all the resolved data so a caller can assemble the final DTO.

The `BatchEnricher` component orchestrates everything — it takes a list of entities, the spec, and a builder function that combines each entity with its enriched context. I'm using a typed `LookupKey` token to avoid unchecked casts when retrieving values from the context.

For implementations, I'm planning a MyBatis loader that wraps a `BaseMapper` with soft-delete filtering, a user display loader that caches individual lookups since there's no batch API, and support for custom inline lambdas. Each business enricher then declares its spec once as a static field and reuses it across calls.

In the `AssignmentSummaryEnricher`, I'm wiring up the dependencies and building the spec in the constructor by chaining lookups for tasks, items, and labeler names. The enrichment method delegates to `BatchEnricher` with a reference to the builder, which reconstructs the summary by pulling enriched data from the context.

The user wants a truly generic framework that works across different entity types, not just tasks. I should create convenience helpers like `TaskItemDisplayLookups` to avoid repeating the spec assembly pattern in multiple enrichers, then present this redesigned approach to confirm it matches their scope.

